1057:\section{Experimental Setup Details}
1058:\label{app:setup}
1108:\item \textbf{LoRA}~\citep{hu2022lora}: 108-run sweep (12 configurations $\times$ 3 seeds $\times$ 3 datasets) over rank, target projections, and forecast head; full table in Appendix~\ref{app:lora_sweep}.
